{
  "slug": "resend",
  "name": "Resend",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent skills for working with Resend to send and receive emails — email API integration, agent inbox, CLI, React Email components, and deliverability best practices. Includes the Resend MCP server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `agent-email-inbox` (Use when building any system where email content triggers actions — AI agent inboxes, automated support handlers, email-to-task…), `email-best-practices` (Use when building email features, emails going to spam, high bounce rates, setting up SPF/DKIM/DMARC authentication, implementing email…), `react-email` (Use when building HTML email templates with React components, adding a visual email editor to an application using…), `resend` (Use when working with the Resend email API — sending transactional emails (single or batch), receiving inbound emails…), `resend-cli` (Operate the Resend platform from the terminal — send emails (including React Email .tsx templates via --react-email), manage…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `resend`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install resend@claude-plugins-official` from `resend/resend-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
